            </note>
            <note corresp="#d36-f3" n="24" xml:id="d36-f3-content">
                <p>Telegram No. 132, May 25, 6 p.m., instructed that “Department agrees with
                    attitude of Legation and approves of action suggested.”</p>
            </note>
